{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e44a419b610a5e71","name":"The Believers","source":{"id":"source:reference-e44a419b610a5e71","title":"The Believers","revision":19831,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:41:42Z","sha256":"1388160aa3d2d61c31a914d428f3e572efa6e2b92ac9f69a63acb86659b87859","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19831","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Believers&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e44a419b610a5e71","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Rising to prominence shortly after the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"},", The Believers, based in the Cularin System, are a cult of Force-sensitive beings. Members devote their energies to studying and embracing ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", with the intent of following the doctrines and customs of the ancient Sith that existed before ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Bane"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Bane","referenceId":"reference:16f1400dee26a7e1"},". Rejecting Bane's Rule of Two, The Believers seek to expand their numbers to eventually challenge ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," directly and usher in a new age for ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"},". All Believers can be recognized by a distinctive tattoo, a shape that resembles the spire of the Sith fortress on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Almas"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Almas","referenceId":"reference:11673f48c5b0ad05"}," with a broken ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," at its base.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At first, the existence of The Believers is thought to be nothing more than rumor, since their presence cannot be confirmed by even ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},". During ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", however, Jedi stationed in the Cularin System slowly begin turning to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," and joining The Believers, confirming the existence of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," cult and increasing its size. As their numbers swell, The Believers create a plague virus to eradicate the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Caarite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Caarite"}," race and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Metatheran Cartel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Metatheran_Cartel?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Initially, the virus is successful, but it is stopped by a counteragent created from samples of the virus recovered from early victims of the plague. With their plans foiled, The Believers abandon the Sith Temple on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Almas"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Almas","referenceId":"reference:11673f48c5b0ad05"}," and go underground for a short time. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Believers return later, when ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Darkstaff"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Darkstaff?action=edit&redlink=1"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Artifact"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Artifact?action=edit&redlink=1"},", attempts to protect itself from a group of agents that discover its connection to the shadow lurkers and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Oblee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Oblee?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Found by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Len Markus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Len_Markus?action=edit&redlink=1"}," in the Cularin asteroid belt, the artifact possesses him and rises to become the new leader of The Believers. ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Darkstaff"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Darkstaff?action=edit&redlink=1"}," calls on The Believers to destroy the freelance agents that hunted it. However, the agents manage to thwart The Believers and free the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Oblee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Oblee?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Membership:"]}," Anyone with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"}," feat and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," of 1 or higher is welcome to join The Believers by being accepted as an apprentice by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Adept"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Adept","referenceId":"reference:951932a80cdb57b1"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Disciple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Disciple","referenceId":"reference:171d559c4356997f"}," of the cult. Members of The Believers gain access to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Believer Disciple Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Believer_Disciple_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:55487f1a62587660"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Believer Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Nonheroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Believer Cultist"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Believer_Cultist","referenceId":"reference:69ac734c639b1044"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 3\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Lizard"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Lizard","referenceId":"reference:fa732994ded98eb8"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Believer Cultist Leader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Believer_Cultist_Leader","referenceId":"reference:36a781ddddc9290a"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Believer Zealot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Believer_Zealot","referenceId":"reference:c6c5ea451b871cb2"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Lizard Alpha"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Lizard_Alpha","referenceId":"reference:f1ab80da1d12beb0"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 8\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"br","children":[]},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
